WEBVTT

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:18.240
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:18.240
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:24.290
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:24.290
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:41.060
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:41.060
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:46.060
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:46.060
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:51.280
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:51.280
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:56.450
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:56.450
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:56.610 --> 00:01:01.870
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:00:56.610 --> 00:01:01.870
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:07.670
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:07.670
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:12.670
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:12.670
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:17.760
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:17.760
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:22.640
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:22.640
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:28.440
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:28.440
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:34.280
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:34.280
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:41.490
<i>The mysterious world where Digimon live,
the Digital World.</i>

00:01:42.490 --> 00:01:48.080
<i>Taichi Yagami and the Chosen Ones
with their partner Digimon</i>

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:50.380
<i>continue their adventure.</i>

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:54.920
<i>During their journey one day...</i>

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:57.170
There!

00:01:58.380 --> 00:01:59.930
Here it goes, Gabumon!

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:01.680
Give it here, Agumon!

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:03.930
Hup!

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:05.940
Alright!

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:07.890
Huh? Whoa!

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:10.060
Sora!

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:11.480
Okay!

00:02:16.150 --> 00:02:17.740
Hup!

00:02:19.280 --> 00:02:19.990
Huh?

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:24.850
Goal!

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:26.250
You did it, Sora!

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:30.000
It's because your crosses
are always accurate.

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:32.000
Agumon!

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:33.880
Got it!

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:37.170
It's mine!

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:39.740
Everyone, block Sora!

00:02:39.740 --> 00:02:40.510
Alrighty!

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:47.020
Hey, wait! You can't do that!

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:50.060
What's wrong?

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:51.770
-Tentomon, that's a foul!
-What?!

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:55.740
You can't hold someone in soccer.

00:02:55.740 --> 00:02:57.780
Jeez, how odd is that?

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:01.160
Soccer's pretty difficult.

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:03.030
The ball's our friend!

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:06.210
Then I'm gonna have
a direct free kick from here!

00:03:06.210 --> 00:03:07.040
Here I go.

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:10.290
Hup!

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:12.670
Hup!

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:13.750
Oh...

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:17.800
Mmm, what a nice sound.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:20.800
Where did that whistle come from?

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:25.070
It was in this runaway bag
that my brother gave me.

00:03:25.070 --> 00:03:26.060
Really.

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:30.060
A whistle for a runaway.
What in the world for?

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:35.060
Obviously, it's for when I run
into a bear in the mountains!

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:38.780
Sora-san and Taichi-san's really good.

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:39.690
Yup.

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:43.830
They're both the soccer club's stars.

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:46.950
Their specialty is teamwork.

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:48.200
Here I go!

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:50.450
No one's coming this way...

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:55.750
Let's take a quick break!

00:03:56.250 --> 00:04:00.340
Ahh... Playing soccer feels great!

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:01.550
Right, Taichi?

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:02.630
Yep.

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:22.820
STRIKE! THE KILLER SHOT

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:24.820
What...

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:26.530
...is that?

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:28.030
An island?

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:31.620
It's huge.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:36.880
Don't tell me it's gonna fall here.

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:44.350
What's that?

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:46.100
Could they be bombs?!

00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:47.100
What?!

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:50.310
Everybody! Run! Hide! Take cover!

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:01.240
What...

00:05:01.240 --> 00:05:02.570
...is that?

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:06.490
Is it a meteor?

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:10.910
Hey...

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:16.750
I smell something yummy.

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:24.760
Is this...

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:27.220
...a fruit?

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:30.260
Looks like it.

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:35.520
It's yummy!

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:38.020
I want some too!

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:41.110
Isn't that too small to share
with everybody?

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:43.440
Ah, you're right.

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:47.530
If we get up there,
maybe we can find more fruits.

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:50.450
I'll go get some for everybody!

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:52.080
Right, Taichi?

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:54.910
Yeah, let's do it!

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:56.160
I'll go too!

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:58.210
Piyomon Evolution!

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:00.250
Birdramon!

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:02.380
Here we go!

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:03.420
See ya soon!

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:04.920
We're counting on you!

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:07.840
-Look hard!
-See you soon!

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:11.660
Huh? Is that...

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:13.930
Something's coming again.

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:16.980
I wonder what kind of fruit is next!

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:34.490
A refrigerator?!

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:37.790
Birdramon, c'mon, hurry!

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:39.000
Roger that!

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:43.000
Fruits, fruits!

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:46.010
-I can't wait!
-Sora, you're in a good mood.

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:48.220
Can you tell?

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:51.090
We haven't played soccer
like that in a while.

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:55.470
Say, Taichi!

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:58.350
Do you remember that one match?

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:01.190
You know, when I was a forward

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:04.150
and you were a midfielder
for the first time?

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:08.400
Oh, that. I remember.

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:14.410
Soon, I hope we can play soccer
all we want just like before!

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:18.870
Since all we did was play soccer
before we came to this world.

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:22.210
From now on, let's practice
once in a while like earlier!

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:23.210
Sure.

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:27.680
What's that?

00:07:27.680 --> 00:07:28.760
Birdramon!

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:33.510
That's...

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:35.390
Flymon!

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:39.980
POMUMON

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:41.610
Let's save them!

00:07:41.610 --> 00:07:42.480
Agumon!

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:43.940
Yeah! Baby--

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:46.900
Oh, wait! You'll hit them too.

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:50.070
Birdramon, tackle them!

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:51.400
Okay!

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:11.300
Are you okay?

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:16.930
Please help!

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:21.230
My friends are going to be
turned into fruits and get eaten!

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:23.810
Fruits?!

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:27.440
What is it?!

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:28.440
Watch out!

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:34.280
If you get hit by that, you'll melt.

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:36.700
Birdramon, be careful!

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:37.870
Okay!

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:44.670
What is that?!

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:48.090
It's Toropiamon's Tropical Venom.

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:49.630
Toropiamon?

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:01.470
TOROPIAMON

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:26.620
That Pomumon really turned into a fruit!

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:28.630
That means...

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:32.130
Those fruits are all your friends?

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:33.010
Yeah.

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:35.630
They're not the same
as the one I ate earlier.

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:39.350
Now, I'm the only one left.

00:09:39.350 --> 00:09:40.680
Everybody...

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:44.890
Let's land once and think of a plan!

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:51.400
So?

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:53.610
What are we gonna do with this?

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:55.280
Should we open it?

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:57.400
Open it?! N-No way!

00:09:57.910 --> 00:10:00.410
It'll be bad if something bad came out!

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:02.910
That is a possibility.

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:06.790
It's a refrigerator,
so maybe there's something tasty inside!

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:09.170
Like some cold fruits or some juice.

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:12.460
Fruits... Juice...

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:13.550
Go, go!

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:14.510
Here!

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:15.460
<i>Huh?</i>

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:18.470
What is all this?

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:21.600
They've been falling from the sky lately.

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:22.720
From the sky?

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:27.020
We've been living here in peace
from a long time ago.

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:29.480
But one day,

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:33.480
<i>Toropiamon, who was leading
the Flymon, suddenly appeared.</i>

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:36.200
And you guys were attacked.

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:40.240
Yeah. They like to collect everything.

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:42.750
<i>But not only that,</i>

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:47.500
<i>they turn us into fruits like that
once they catch us, and when we're ripe...</i>

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:49.590
You get eaten.

00:10:49.590 --> 00:10:50.500
Yeah.

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:52.250
How cruel.

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:55.420
I want to save everyone.

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:59.380
I want to take this jungle back from them!

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:00.430
Yeah.

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:02.260
We'll help!

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:03.970
Right, Taichi?!

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:04.930
Yeah!

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:06.560
We'll save them for sure!

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:08.390
Alright, let's do it!

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:11.900
Everyone... thank you.

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:15.650
Piyomon.

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:16.820
Okay!

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:19.450
Piyomon Evolution!

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:26.290
Birdramon!

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:32.170
Agumon Evolution!

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.300
Greymon!

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:42.800
Greymon Super Evolution!

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:49.350
Metalgreymon!

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:52.100
Alright, let's go!

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:53.560
Okay!

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:07.200
Like I said, mixed juice
is different from fruit juice!

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:11.580
There's an old craftsmanship involved
in the making of--

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:14.210
Who cares? As long as it tastes good!

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:15.550
I care!

00:12:15.550 --> 00:12:18.340
Y-You guys! Calm down a bit!

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:21.840
I am very calm. Can't you tell?

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:26.300
Here we go!

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:29.220
Giga Storm!

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:35.350
Alright, good!

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:43.360
Toropiamon flew!

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:46.660
So fast!

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:51.080
Meteor Wing!

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:01.340
Birdramon!

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:39.130
Metalgreymon!

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:44.260
Taichi!

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:52.310
What did you do to Taichi?!

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:57.100
Birdramon Super Evolution!

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:02.020
Garudamon!

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:06.610
I'm going to go save Taichi and Pomumon!

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:10.200
Garudamon, keep Toropiamon busy
in the meantime!

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:11.620
Got it.

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.880
I'll fly on my own.

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:24.630
What? But...

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:25.880
Don't worry!

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:48.950
Flying's tough.

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:56.750
Pomumon!

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:03.590
Ouch!

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:04.920
Are you all right?!

00:15:06.010 --> 00:15:09.510
Yeah! I have to save my friends!

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:12.760
That's the spirit! Let's go!

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:17.520
Flymon?!

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:22.440
There's more!

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:26.230
Shadow Wing!

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:32.530
What?!

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:41.870
Sora!

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:47.420
I'll take care of this.

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:49.630
You go save your friends.

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:51.550
What?! How?

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:52.720
Good luck!

00:15:56.810 --> 00:15:58.100
Over here!

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:23.040
Yes!

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:25.800
-You're the one who saved me?
-Yeah.

00:16:25.800 --> 00:16:27.290
Thank you!

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:31.300
We need to save everyone else too.

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:32.760
Help me!

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:33.840
Okay!

00:16:35.390 --> 00:16:36.600
But...

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:39.770
flying's tough.

00:16:39.770 --> 00:16:41.310
I know.

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:43.980
Shadow Wing!

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:11.880
Sora!

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:13.590
Taichi!

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:17.010
Taichi!

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:19.260
What did you do to Taichi?!

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:28.610
I swear I'm gonna save Taichi!

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:44.370
Sora, run!

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:46.960
-What?
-Just run!

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:56.870
I swear... I won't give up!

00:17:56.870 --> 00:17:58.340
Sora!

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:03.140
Taichi would never give up.

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:06.190
So neither will I!

00:18:09.860 --> 00:18:12.690
Sora would never give up.

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:17.820
So I won't give up either!

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:28.830
Shadow Wing!

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:35.960
Taichi...

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:44.140
Rapid Seed!

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:48.640
Huh?!

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:04.790
I was able to protect my friends!

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:08.160
I have to, too!

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:19.050
Thank goodness, Taichi!

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:22.970
Sora!

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:25.060
Let's counter attack from here!

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:27.310
Right! Let's go!

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:28.140
Yeah!

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:56.710
We gotta stop that attack.

00:19:58.550 --> 00:19:59.880
This!

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:02.130
Huh?

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:04.640
Go, Sora!

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:14.400
I see!

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:16.480
Alright, go, Sora!

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:23.410
Now, everybody!

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:27.410
Rapid Seed!

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:40.130
This'll finish you!

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:48.760
Shadow Wing!

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:52.390
Giga Storm!

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:02.650
Yes!

00:21:04.030 --> 00:21:04.950
Sora!

00:21:05.660 --> 00:21:07.240
You were awesome!

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:08.740
What?

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:10.960
Really?

00:21:10.960 --> 00:21:12.750
Yes, very!

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:15.420
I knew you were awesome, Sora!

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:23.420
Thank you!

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:33.180
<i>The border has now begun to blend</i>

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:33.180
<i>ima mazari atteku border</i>

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:36.020
<i>"It's uncharted territory from here!"</i>

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:36.020
<i>koko kara wa jinrui mitou desu!</i>

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:38.560
<i>Blue skies, the ends of the ocean</i>

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:38.560
<i>aoi sora umi no hate</i>

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:42.650
<i>All that you desire awaits you</i>

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:42.650
<i>nozomu kagiri no subete ga aru kara</i>

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:55.910
<i>The end doesn't exist, that's right</i>

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:55.910
<i>owari nanka nai ze sou sa</i>

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:58.580
<i>We're at our starting point right now</i>

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:58.580
<i>koko wa ima bokura no shuppatsuten</i>

00:21:58.750 --> 00:22:01.210
<i>Blue skies, the ends of the ocean</i>

00:21:58.750 --> 00:22:01.210
<i>aoi sora umi no hate</i>

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:04.800
<i>There's a tomorrow that no one knows about</i>

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:04.800
<i>dare mo shiranai asu wa aru kara</i>

00:22:04.970 --> 00:22:06.800
<i>So keep on smiling</i>

00:22:04.970 --> 00:22:06.800
<i>waratte iyou</i>

00:22:06.970 --> 00:22:10.760
<i>We're past the point of stopping
In our daily lives</i>

00:22:06.970 --> 00:22:10.760
<i>imasara tachidomarenu bokura no
nichijou jou</i>

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:12.260
<i>Bring on the unknown!</i>

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:12.260
<i>michi joutou!</i>

00:22:12.430 --> 00:22:14.600
<i>That day, I drew on the wall with you</i>

00:22:12.430 --> 00:22:14.600
<i>ano hi kimi to kabe ni kaita</i>

00:22:14.770 --> 00:22:17.230
<i>The incomplete, the imperfect</i>

00:22:14.770 --> 00:22:17.230
<i>mikansei wo fukanzen wo</i>

00:22:17.390 --> 00:22:19.940
<i>"You can't go anywhere at this point"</i>

00:22:17.390 --> 00:22:19.940
<i>imasara doko e mo ikenai ze tte</i>

00:22:20.110 --> 00:22:22.650
<i>Oh, is that so?! Oh, is that so?!</i>

00:22:20.110 --> 00:22:22.650
<i>aa sou kai nee! aa sou kai nee!</i>

00:22:22.820 --> 00:22:28.740
<i>Then we don't want to become a grown-up</i>

00:22:22.820 --> 00:22:28.740
<i>nara otona ni nanka natcha ikenai nee</i>

00:22:31.240 --> 00:22:32.910
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:35.910
<i>Marinangemon.</i>

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:38.670
<i>This mythical Digimon
inhabits the Net Ocean.</i>

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:38.670
LEVEL: MEGA

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:41.000
TYPE: FAIRY

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:42.840
<i>The special move, Ocean Love,
crushes the enemy's battle spirit.</i>

00:22:41.170 --> 00:22:43.340
SPECIAL MOVE: OCEAN LOVE

00:22:43.550 --> 00:22:45.260
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

