is the same as Tailmon's.</i>

00:22:48.760 --> 00:22:50.340
<i>It's not just a fashion item.</i>

00:22:50.510 --> 00:22:52.350
<i>What is this Holy Ring?</i>

00:22:52.510 --> 00:22:55.060
<i>I'm going to
go find Marinangemon right now!</i>

00:22:57.770 --> 00:23:00.020
